# Unity 6 Deployment Conventions

Package: `com.unity.ai.inference` (Sentis 2.5+). Namespace: `Unity.InferenceEngine`.

## Sentis Batched Inference Template

```csharp
using UnityEngine;
using Unity.InferenceEngine;

public class BatchedPolicyInference : MonoBehaviour
{
    [SerializeField] private ModelAsset policyAsset;
    private Model runtimeModel;
    private Worker worker;

    // obs_dim and action_dim must match the ONNX model
    private const int OBS_DIM = 159;   // proprioception(48) + raycasts(100) + context(11)
    private const int ACTION_DIM = 12; // joint position targets

    void Start()
    {
        runtimeModel = ModelLoader.Load(policyAsset);
        worker = new Worker(runtimeModel, BackendType.GPUCompute);
    }

    public float[] RunBatched(float[,] observations, int batchSize)
    {
        // observations shape: [batchSize, OBS_DIM]
        var inputTensor = new Tensor<float>(new TensorShape(batchSize, OBS_DIM));
        // Fill tensor from observations array...

        var outputTensor = worker.Schedule(inputTensor).PeekOutput() as Tensor<float>;
        var result = outputTensor.ReadbackAndClone();

        inputTensor.Dispose();
        return ExtractActions(result, batchSize);
    }

    void OnDestroy()
    {
        worker?.Dispose();
    }
}
```

## LOD AI Zone Thresholds

**Do not treat “far” or “off-screen” as “no simulation.”** Only **rendering** and **inference cost** drop; ecosystem logic (hunts, births, resources, environment deltas) continues via **abstract/macro ticks** and **hydration** when the player arrives. Full spec: `ARCHITECTURE.md` §8, §13.

| Zone | Distance | AI / sim method | Notes |
|------|----------|-----------------|-------|
| 1 | 0-50m | Full Sentis policy | Every frame; full physics |
| 2 | 50-150m | Sentis (full or distilled) | Every 3-5 frames + interpolate |
| 3 | 150m+ | Coarse NN and/or meso physics | Capsule/steering OK; preserve interaction ranges |
| Off-screen | N/A | `AbstractEcosystemTick` + parcels | Macro state: predation, repro, positions; hydrate on player entry |

