## LOD Manager Pattern

```csharp
public class AILODManager : MonoBehaviour
{
    private Camera mainCam;
    private readonly List<AgentBrain> zone1 = new();
    private readonly List<AgentBrain> zone2 = new();
    private readonly List<AgentBrain> zone3 = new();

    void Update()
    {
        ClassifyAgents();          // Sort agents into zones by distance
        RunZone1Inference();       // Full batched Sentis inference
        if (Time.frameCount % 4 == 0) RunZone2Inference(); // Reduced freq
        // Zone 3: handled by AgentBrain's built-in FSM
    }
}
```

## Rendering LOD (NOT GPU Resident Drawer)

GPU Resident Drawer does NOT work with Animator components. Instead:
- Zone 1: Animator with full skeletal animation
- Zone 2: Vertex Animation Textures (VAT) with GPU instancing
- Zone 3: Billboard impostors with baked animation frames

## Key Constraints

- All C# scripts use `Unity.InferenceEngine` namespace (NOT the old `Unity.Sentis`).
- Use `BackendType.GPUCompute` — fastest on RTX GPUs with DirectML.
- ALWAYS dispose tensors and workers to prevent VRAM leaks.
- Batch all same-zone agents into ONE forward pass — never run per-agent inference.
